{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your only advantage? The nearest enemy.</strong><br>From nimble archers to hulking brutes, every foe is a new tool in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.poster.avif?t=1751734566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.webm?t=1751734566\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.mp4?t=1751734566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Real-time Transformation</strong> \u2013 Instantly take the form of any enemy you defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Dash, strike, and react quickly in fast-paced, skill-based encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong> \u2013 Every enemy has strengths and weaknesses. Choosing who to become can be the difference between victory and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Card System</strong> \u2013 Pick temporary upgrades during each run to create powerful ability combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade Shop</strong> \u2013 Purchase permanent enhancements between runs to evolve your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong> \u2013 How long can you last before the world consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No one masters monsters better than the one who becomes them.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847670?t=1751734566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/6bd5a6e29ee65ecc859d607676fdecfb667d47a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751734566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/3dc4fd1255f1905dc9b216ba1d8d8e5ca1f215d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751734566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/3dc4fd1255f1905dc9b216ba1d8d8e5ca1f215d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751734566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your only advantage? The nearest enemy.</strong><br>From nimble archers to hulking brutes, every foe is a new tool in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.poster.avif?t=1751734566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.webm?t=1751734566\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/5d3648f211c96866e8f745c36b0d4495.mp4?t=1751734566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Real-time Transformation</strong> \u2013 Instantly take the form of any enemy you defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Dash, strike, and react quickly in fast-paced, skill-based encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong> \u2013 Every enemy has strengths and weaknesses. Choosing who to become can be the difference between victory and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Card System</strong> \u2013 Pick temporary upgrades during each run to create powerful ability combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade Shop</strong> \u2013 Purchase permanent enhancements between runs to evolve your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong> \u2013 How long can you last before the world consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No one masters monsters better than the one who becomes them.</strong></p>","developers":["Golden Adam Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/8e2fcd82023c028ecd4a8d8e7993db48d57dab41/header.jpg?t=1751734566","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163103,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163103/movie480.mp4?t=1751492843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163103/movie_max.mp4?t=1751492843"},"name":"Kinap Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163103/966ab77ab7c52c7188be11baf998371ad5216244/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751492843","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163103/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751492843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163103/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751492843"}}],"name":"Kinap","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Processador Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-4210U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","reco